1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,800
Your contract chunk doesn't know
what its own words mean.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:07,350
And your RAG system is
answering from it anyway.

3
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:14,650
"Confidential Information" is defined in
Section 1.4, and used in Section 9.

4
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:18,925
A Section 9 chunk on its own
doesn't say what it covers.

5
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:25,171
So extract the definitions into a lookup table,
and attach the ones each retrieved

6
00:00:25,171 --> 00:00:25,925
chunk uses.

7
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:29,825
Don't inline them into every
chunk at index time.

8
00:00:30,125 --> 00:00:34,750
That bloats the chunk, and dilutes its
embedding, so retrieval gets worse.

9
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:38,900
The full chunking strategy
is on vidyal.ai.
